OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 28 Aug to Sun 6 SepFA
OL,6,Frelatively unsettled start to this
OL,7,Fperiod, as showers or longer spells of
OL,8,Frain are possible across many parts of
OL,9,Fthe UK, along with some strong winds.
OL,10,FSome heavy bursts and thunderstorms
OL,11,Fare likely at times. It will likely
OL,12,Fremain changeable into early
OL,13,FSeptember, with rainfall amounts
OL,14,Fprobably above average for the time
OL,15,Fyear and the potential for some more
OL,16,Fstrong winds at times. However, some
OL,17,Fdrier, more settled interludes could
OL,18,Fdevelop at times. Temperatures are
OL,19,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,20,Fsome short-lived warm or hot spells
OL,21,Fare possible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
